sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WU as worker U: update doc d
    participant WD as worker D: delete doc d
    participant R as regolith

    WU->>R: get_parts(d, parts it uses, alive)
    WD->>R: get(d) and the deletion marker
    WD->>R: put deletion marker, delete index entries, head operand
    WU->>R: merge(d, part operand), index updates
    WD->>R: commit
    R-->>WD: committed: d is deleted
    WU->>R: commit
    Note over R: a newer delete touched what the update read
    R-->>WU: Conflict: mine ReadParts, theirs Delete
    Note over WU: business logic: the document is gone, report not-found, and no index entry is re-added
